      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p><p>Am i having some trouble with the store and ordering and no has replied to my email i sent to gtg and i figured this would be the place to ask. I recently recieved sentinels of the multiverse and loved it so much i decided to buy the mini-expansions and the new shattered timeline expansion off the store. When i placed the order i recieved an email saying i bought want i bought.</p><p>However when i go to the order section of my account it says for the same order that i bought rook city and infernal relics which i already own. Can someone clarify just what is going on here.</p><p>Note: there is this error \"<em>Notice</em><span>: Undefined index: count in&nbsp;</span><em>menu_primary_local_tasks()</em><span>&nbsp;(line&nbsp;</span><em>2221</em><span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><em>/var/www/greaterthangames.com/htdocs/includes/menu.inc</em><span>). </span><span>\"above in my ordering page if that helps anything</span></p><p><br>thanks in advance</p><p>Jetpack123</p>",
